-- ============================================================================
-- KinetoFun — Migration 0004
-- SuperAdmin platform expansion: Categories, enhanced Games, Audit Logs.
-- ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- Runs AFTER schema.sql + 0001 + 0003. Idempotent (safe to re-run).
